# F-VV-3: radius growth beyond the init-time maximum radius (cutneighmax / bins / ghost cutoff are not updated).
# Two spheres at rest, centre distance 5 mm, radius grows 1 mm -> 3 mm (overlap 1 mm at the end).
# Expected if contacts are detected: strong repulsion (|vx| >> 0). Hypothesis: no force (missed contact).
# Also run with -np 2 and 'processors 2 1 1' (uncomment) to test the ghost cutoff.
atom_style    granular
atom_modify   map array
boundary      f f f
newton        off
communicate   single vel yes
#processors   2 1 1
units         si
region        reg block -0.02 0.02 -0.02 0.02 -0.02 0.02 units box
create_box    1 reg
neighbor      0.0005 bin
neigh_modify  delay 0
fix  m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 1e7
fix  m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3
fix  m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix  m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.5
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history
pair_coeff * *
timestep 1e-6
create_atoms 1 single -0.0025 0.0 0.0
create_atoms 1 single  0.0025 0.0 0.0
set group all diameter 0.002 density 2500
variable r equal 0.001+0.002*step/20000
fix integr all nve/sphere
fix grow all adapt/liggghts 1 radius v_r
variable vx1 equal vx[1]
variable vx2 equal vx[2]
variable gap equal x[2]-x[1]-2*v_r
thermo_style custom step v_r v_gap v_vx1 v_vx2 ke
thermo 2000
run 20000
